DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T220000
UID:116cc75fe3eef0091077b6939a19a530@visitsantarosa.com
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Left Edge Theatre. At the MacGregor Plantation\, 
 the antebellum South collides with the present in a provocative fever drea
 m where race\, desire\, gender\, and power intertwine. Nothing is quite as
  it seems—and yet everything is. Jeremy O. Harris’s explosive\, award-
 winning Slave Play rips apart the boundaries between history and modern Am
 erica\, confronting the enduring legacy of slavery and the complex interse
 ctions of race\, gender\, and sexuality. Recommended for ages 17+. Contain
 s nudi
LOCATION:The California\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/slave-play/
X-SOURCE:Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
